  "totalBlocks": 21,
  "translatedBlocks": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "554d47684790e417",
      "translationZh": "Deskpilot：一款采用 Python/Tkinter 的原生智能体式桌面客户端，面向本地 LLM，支持 Model Context Protocol (MCP)、工具沙箱隔离，以及多得多的其他功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7108d0effbcf05aa",
      "translationZh": "我（在 Qwen 3.8 27B 的大量帮助下）构建了一款原生、独立的桌面 AI 客户端应用，完全使用 Python + Tkinter 开发，配备兼容 OpenAI 的后端，并采用安全优先的智能体架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5563fb95ba0b2041",
      "translationZh": "通用本地后端支持：可连接 Ollama、LM Studio、vLLM、llama.cpp、Unsloth Desktop，或任何兼容 OpenAI 的端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de3ab68f87589a45",
      "translationZh": "MCP 集成：内置一个无依赖的 stdio JSON-RPC 2.0 客户端。你可以在设置中接入任何外部 MCP 服务器，Deskpilot 会即时将服务器的工具动态转换为 OpenAI 函数调用模式定义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48dcd60374f4c9e7",
      "translationZh": "细粒度工具权限栏：每个内置工具和动态 MCP 工具都在主窗口中有一个下拉菜单（始终允许、请求许可或关闭）。未经审查的工具默认设为请求许可，并使用线程安全的提示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c780904612a0729",
      "translationZh": "网页搜索与抓取：本地 SearXNG、Exa 神经搜索，以及 Firecrawl 抓取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c19f8829b6c463",
      "translationZh": "操作系统与系统功能：文件读写（支持文本和 PDF）、目录列表、剪贴板读取、屏幕截图（排队供视觉模型处理），以及沙箱隔离的 Node.js JavaScript 执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ff82d6adab88078",
      "translationZh": "推理/思考支持：原生支持 <think> / reasoning_content 的流式输出（DeepSeek-R1、Qwen 等）。它在可折叠的抽屉面板中显示推理内容，记录思考阶段的耗时，并在常规生成开始时自动将其折叠为“思考了 X.Xs”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ba5c569cad3a4ad",
      "translationZh": "STT（听写）：由本地运行的 faster-whisper（在 CPU 上以 int8 运行 base.en）提供持续麦克风听写。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7d1daf43b6cfe11",
      "translationZh": "TTS（播放）：由本地运行的 kokoro-onnx 提供自然的文本转语音，使用前瞻流水线消除句子间的延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e9c172d4d982a82",
      "translationZh": "智能上下文交接与指标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b10b4621e250f9f7",
      "translationZh": "显示准确的解码 tok/s（分母不计入预填充耗时）、TTFT，以及实时的已用 / 最大上下文用量指示器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "587bf0b199e3360e",
      "translationZh": "（我个人很喜欢这个功能）当你的聊天达到用户定义的上下文阈值（例如 75%）时，Deskpilot 会自动触发结构化的交接摘要，让你无缝转入新的对话会话，而不会发生上下文溢出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ee9c52cd63ef7c1",
      "translationZh": "安全与架构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95d39f27d1976a89",
      "translationZh": "运行具备工具访问权限的本地智能体模型需要安全护栏：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e40ac62446d94d9a",
      "translationZh": "SSRF 与 DNS 重绑定防护：fetch_url 默认会检查并阻止发往环回地址（127.0.0.1）、局域网子网（RFC1918）以及云元数据 IP 地址范围的请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4be5cbae3f0925e",
      "translationZh": "文件系统沙箱隔离：严格阻止访问核心操作系统目录（C:、/etc 等），并支持可选的用户自定义工作区目录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cb3155425ac95d4",
      "translationZh": "纯守护线程机制：所有工具执行、推理流式输出和音频处理均在后台工作线程上运行，并通过线程安全队列安全地传递给 Tkinter，以保持 UI 完全流畅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64f3f54cc6115e3e",
      "translationZh": "它可直接通过 Python（3.10+）运行，也可使用 PyInstaller 编译为单个 .exe 文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "789170ba3dfbf5a2",
      "translationZh": "Linux 和 Windows 的逐步安装说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
